# The backup bucket, S3-compatible, that Litestream copies the database to and rclone the attachments (redix-api #140 D5, #145). Fill a copy
# on the PC, outside the repository; setup.sh installs it as /etc/redix/backup.env (mode 600). Only the backups read it, never the API.
REDIX_BACKUP_BUCKET=
REDIX_BACKUP_ENDPOINT=
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
